      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Have you tried using the structure mentioned in https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/vpm/cli#new ?\n\nThe format is `vpm new <projectName> [template] [-p path]`, so if you want to make a new avatar from our template and put it on your desktop, you could run `vpm new MyProjectName Avatar -p ~/Desktop`. If you have your own template you want to use, try `vpm new MyProjectName \"/path/to/your/template\" -p ~/Desktop`.\n\nYou can get the path of a folder in Finder if you right-click, hold Option on your keyboard, and select \"Copy _ as Pathname\".",
